WEBVTT

00:00:03.207 --> 00:00:07.801
Try Again creates a new try of the same activity, with the attempt

00:00:07.801 --> 00:00:09.460
count raised by one.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:14.437
Pick No Answer, and set the maximum attempts, here three tries in total.

00:00:14.887 --> 00:00:20.525
The assignment type keeps the same owner, or gives the follow-up to a specific user.

00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:25.536
Default schedule hours says how many hours later it is scheduled, here 24.

00:00:25.536 --> 00:00:29.107
The agent can change the date on the Complete page.

00:00:29.107 --> 00:00:30.297
Click Create.

